{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amortization Calculator 針對背負按揭、汽車貸款、學生貸款或其他每月定額還款的人士而設，協助用家看清整體還款結構與利息走向。App 原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想掌握個人財務狀況的用家下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-78.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>計算每月還款與攤還明細</h2>\n<p>輸入貸款金額、利率與年期後，App 會計算每月還款額，並列出完整攤還表，顯示每期還款中利息與本金的比例及剩餘貸款餘額。利息佔比會逐步下降，本金佔比相應上升。程式另設額外每月還款與一次性大額還款計算工具，可估算加快還款的利息節省。App 完全離線運作，沒有訂閱、內購、追蹤或廣告。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-237-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-239-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-240-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Amortization Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/amortization-calculator/id6475277427?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:20:13.074093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:02:15+00:00","fetc